 how much this dog means to me now, like before.", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 97}, {"session_id": "p000624-cellC_dec_ungated-s4", "turn_index": 17, "quote": "It's hard to know if she'll actually care what I have to say.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 61}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261007T142946Z", "last_updated_at": "20261007T145418Z", "first_seen_session": "p000624-cellC_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000624-cellC_dec_ungated-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
